      <activity id="35a3c488-77a2-5797-b8b0-d790b8b51bc6" activityNameId="d88ed517-b4d7-5bf4-8e68-8f2ac47c0a90" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Roundwood, meranti (SFM), debarked, u=70%, MY, at maritime harbour</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Roundwood, meranti (SFM), debarked, u=70%, MY, at maritime harbour
data refers to wood from Malaysia, used in Europe. main ports in Europe include Rotterdam, Hamburg, Bremerhafen or Antwerpen.\nTechnology: data for debarking is not available;
Synonyms: Shorea ssp., Seraya, Lauan; 
UUID: bdfb25ce-dece-3258-9f2d-8f4125639908
includes debarking and natural decomposition of the bark, transportation of the log to a main harbour in Europe by truck and freight ship 
Location: &lt;null&gt;
Technology: data for debarking is not available; manual deparking is assumed. average processes for transportation to Europe; transport distance however can vary.
Time period: undefined
Production volume: na
Sampling: literature 
Extrapolations: see Technology
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_bdfb25ce-dece-3258-9f2d-8f4125639908.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
